{
  "_comment": [
    "Extra aliases merged into the gazetteer at load time, for names the stem",
    "derivation in load_sectors.py cannot reach. Two kinds belong here:",
    "",
    "1. Irregular case forms. Ukrainian genitives of short city names change the",
    "   stem ('Київ' -> 'Києва'), so trigram similarity collapses to 0.222 and no",
    "   generated stem helps.",
    "2. Colloquial place names that are not administrative units at all.",
    "   'Троєщина' is a residential area inside Деснянський район and appears in",
    "   no boundary layer, but channels use it constantly.",
    "",
    "Keys are matched against the sector's normalised name (see",
    "schemas.normalize_sector: lowercased, 'район'/'область' stripped).",
    "Add to this file whenever a real threat shows up in the logs as",
    "'sector_unmatched' - that log line is exactly what this is for."
  ],
